  "title": "Benutzer:Tanbiruzzaman - Alemannische Wikipedia",
  "text": "Benutzer:Tanbiruzzaman - Alemannische Wikipedia Zum Inhalt springen Us der alemannische Wikipedia, der freie Dial\u00e4kt-Enzyklopedy \u2013 Wikimedian \u2022 SWMT Squad \u2013 My AI-crafted avatar, \u2019cause why not let the bots handle the visuals while I handle the edits. Maybe I'm not from this world! CA Ping me? Hello! Email Analysis Contribution log Xtools Wikiscan GS stats Tanbiruzzaman sign as \ud83e\udeb6- T\u039bNBIRUZZ\u039bM\u039bN [ Talk ] Userboxes To err is human. If this user hasn't erred in ages, Perhaps it's a bot, Block the user in stages. This user is a global sysop . ( verify ) This user is an administrator on Meta-Wiki . ( verify ) This user is an administrator on Wikimedia Incubator . ( verify ) This user is a global rollbacker . ( verify ) This user is a global renamer . ( verify ) This user is a member of the Wikimedia VRT . ( verify ) User language bn -N \u098f \u09ac\u09cd\u09af\u09ac\u09b9\u09be\u09b0\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u09c0\u09b0 \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be \u09ad\u09be\u09b7\u09be\u09b0 \u0989\u09aa\u09b0\u09c7 \u09ae\u09be\u09a4\u09c3\u09ad\u09be\u09b7\u09be\u09b0 \u09ae\u09a4\u09a8 \u09a7\u09be\u09b0\u09a3\u09be \u09b0\u09af\u09bc\u09c7\u099b\u09c7\u0964 en -4 This user has near native speaker knowledge of English . hi -1 \u0907\u0938 \u0938\u0926\u0938\u094d\u092f \u0915\u094b \u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 \u0915\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u093e\u0925\u092e\u093f\u0915 \u091c\u094d\u091e\u093e\u0928 \u0939\u0948\u0964 ur -1 \u06cc\u06c1 \u0635\u0627\u0631\u0641 \u0627\u0631\u062f\u0648 \u06a9\u0627 \u0628\u0646\u06cc\u0627\u062f\u06cc \u0639\u0644\u0645 \u0631\u06a9\u06be\u062a\u0627 \u06c1\u06d2\u06d4 Users by language This user is active on IRC using the nick Tanbiruzzaman . This user operates GSRbot . Hi there! :3 I\u2019m Tanbiruzzaman (he/him) , you can call me Tanbir or T-man or anything related\u2014I'm a Wikimedia enthusiast from Bangladesh . I somehow turned late-night scrolling into a full-time cross-wiki cleanup hobby. My first-ever account edit was on June 2, 2021, on English Wikipedia , which was an innocently misguided attempt to \u201chelp\u201d Wikipedia. >:( But I\u2019ve been a regular reader there ever since. Currently, I serve as a Global sysop (since October 22, 2024), Global rollbacker (since October 8, 2023), Global renamer (since August 17, 2025), and an Administrator on Meta-Wiki (since November 13, 2025). Mostly, I hunt down vandalism, patrol recent changes, and keep Wikimedia projects a little tidier. When I\u2019m not tackling cross-wiki disruptive edits, I\u2019m probably awake at some unreasonable hour\u2014sometimes as a night owl\u2014either tinkering with gadgets, patrolling in English Wikipedia (but mostly in Simple English Wikipedia ), or strumming my guitar (strictly for myself, no TikTok concert here).\u00a0;) If you catch me making a mistake, please don\u2019t hesitate to let me know on my talk page \u2014 I\u2019m always open to corrections. I promise I\u2019ll see it\u2026 eventually\u2026 unless it\u2019s during one of my rare daylight hours. :P You can imagine me as the roaring (Yawning) Kitten Der Inhalt auf dieser Seite wurde von https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Tanbiruzzaman eingebunden . Vun \" https://als.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benutzer:Tanbiruzzaman \" Suech Suech Benutzer : Tanbiruzzaman Abschnitt zuefiege",
